  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Pinou & Co is an independent pet-sitting service based in Gassin, in the heart of the Gulf of Saint-Tropez. The person running it holds the ACACED, the certificate required to look after category 1 and 2 dogs, and has been volunteering with animal welfare associations since 2017.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you book</h2>
      <p>The service offers several formats: home boarding at the dog sitter's place (advertised for up to three weeks, no cage or crate — animals stay in the living area), visits of about an hour once or twice a day at your home, or walks. The advertised coverage area is roughly a 15 km radius around the Gulf of Saint-Tropez. As this is sitting at a private individual's home (rather than a professional facility with dedicated premises), an introductory visit before booking is strongly recommended to check that the setting suits your dog. Prices are not detailed in the sources available — <strong>ask</strong> directly.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: for home boarding at a private individual's place, take the time for a meeting before leaving — also ask to see where your dog will sleep and ask about liability insurance.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Gassin overlooks the Gulf of Saint-Tropez, amid vineyards and pine forests, a few minutes from Saint-Tropez, Sainte-Maxime and Cogolin.</p>
